Z||000000||Gokart'sGirl||07-25-2000||05:04 PM||||Hi I am Gokart'sGirl, I have been lurking here for quite awhile prior to making the plunge and being an official member. Much to Gokarts surprise!<P>I have come to know many of you through your posts thanks to Gokart  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Thanks Gokart! And I have even met a few of you IRL- and I am glad to say~ Not a bad apple in the bunch! You folks in the Fiero community are the nicest, kindest & most thoughtful people I have ever met!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>And although I won't drive the "gokart" any longer, I do like to help work on her - ok I admit it if I don't help I don't get to see Gokart~ rof because he spends most of his "spare" time in the drive with her  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>I do have a genuine fondness and appreciation for these cars, let's face it - it's hard not to see why!  <P>Nice to finally meet you all.  Have a great day!<P>------------------<BR>Gokart'sGirl||||reg||12
Z||000001||tgowens||07-25-2000||05:23 PM||||Hello Gokart'sGirl, welcome to the forum!!! I'm sure you will like it here (of you can put up with all of us!!) as there is humor, education, and general camaraderie here. Sometimes we get a little silly, sometimes we panic and sometimes we just get plain frustrated with these little cars.<P>You are going to have to get a Fiero of your own (another way to see Gokart - have him work on YOURS for a change!)........there are plenty of them around (see the Mall section of the forum) and when you do, send me a picture and I will make you your very own "signature" for here........<P>Again, welcome to the forum!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||DXR_DAD||07-25-2000||06:25 PM||||hello and welcome Gokart's Girl<BR>glad to see more young ladys here<BR>we know you put with us and are little toys<BR>and to that we say thanks!!!!<P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||14
Z||000003||Cliff Pennock||07-25-2000||07:02 PM||||Welcome GK'sG! It's always good to see more female members! I give it   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/icons/icon14.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/icons/icon14.gif">  !<p>[This message has been edited by Cliff Pennock (edited 07-25-2000).]||||reg||7
Z||000004||Coconut||07-25-2000||08:16 PM||||Hi Gokart's Girl,<BR>  Welcome...it's always great too see new members on board! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I gotta hand it to you, taking the time to be with your man while he is spending time working on his Fiero is fantastic. It's great to know a guy can spend time with BOTH of his loves and not have to worry about not spending enough time with the other. Definately a big plus! I know that one from experience. Fiero GTGirl is almost always keeping me company while I'm fixing something on the car. She keeps me laughing even when I would think I would be frustrated. GoKart should consider himself lucky <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I know I am!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Once again, welcome aboard!<P> Cruisin' On, <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Gokart||07-25-2000||09:07 PM||||I DO know how lucky I am and try not to take it for granted! Man I was shocked enough to see my girl post on my pics when I got home last night and thought for sure that would most likely be it forever, but nope! Here she is hangin' with the Fiero crew <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Hey tg how bout a sig for me <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P>------------------<BR> Marc                     87GT||||reg||12
Z||000006||tgowens||07-25-2000||09:11 PM||||Gokart -- I got sidetracked -- so very sorry -- i'll get it done tonight -- watch this space for it.......(so, you just want "Gokart" on it or you want "Gokart and Gokart'sGirl" ? (now, am I trying to start something here or what?) -- seriously, you are both fortunate to have each other - value that, respect each other and long live!!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
