Z||000009||Gokart'sGirl||07-26-2000||10:22 AM||||G <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR><B>Welcome GK'sG! It's always good to see more female members! I give it    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/icons/icon14.gif">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/icons/icon14.gif">   !</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Wow Cliff I am very honored by your welcome - you have the best site on earth for Fiero Lovers  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">!  <P>BTW congrats on your engagement! The best part of finally joining your merry crew is I get to reply on my own to all you wonderful folks.  Thanks Cliff.<P><P>------------------<BR>Gokart'sGirl||||reg||12
Z||000010||Gokart'sGirl||07-26-2000||10:46 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by tgowens:<BR><B>Hello Gokart'sGirl, welcome to the forum!!! I'm sure you will like it here (of you can put up with all of us!!) as there is humor, education, and general camaraderie here. Sometimes we get a little silly, sometimes we panic and sometimes we just get plain frustrated with these little cars.</B>[QUOTE}<P>Thank you so much  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">, I think you are all great-I have been "putting up" with you over Gokart's shoulder for a year now figured it was time for me to do it on my own...lol!<P>[QUOTE]<B>You are going to have to get a Fiero of your own (another way to see Gokart - have him work on YOURS for a change!)........there are plenty of them around (see the Mall section of the forum)</B>[QUOTE]<BR>I'll be honest with you tg, I use to drive the old coupe, but with my sciatica it is just too painful to drive the new gokart-all that shifting and clutch use is murder.<P>[QUOTE]<B> and when you do, send me a picture and I will make you your very own  "signature" for here........</B>[QUOTE]<P>See what did I say - you all are the best! I would love a "tgowens "signature" and I would be honored beyond all measure!  I do believe the Gokart has a few pictures of the original gokart (his that I use to drive, the one that started it all for us) if I can get that scanner to work I will send it over - thank you for your kind welcome and even kinder offer!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>[QUOTE]<B>Again, welcome to the forum!!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thank you tgowens!!<P><P>------------------<BR>Gokart'sGirl||||reg||1
Z||000011||Gokart'sGirl||07-26-2000||10:55 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DXR_DAD:<BR><B>hello and welcome Gokart's Girl<BR>glad to see more young ladys here<BR>we know you put with us and are little toys<BR>and to that we say thanks!!!!<P><BR>DXR_DAD</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Gosh DXR_DAD  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">- wow you all are so kind, thank you for the welcome! As for putting up with you all... it isn't like we girls (and boys) have a choice...to love the owner is to love their "gokart/s"! <P>BTW please send DXR_MOM my best and tell her she was right - about 6 months ago she offered to have a chat with me about all this! Sorry it took me sooooo long to get here I missed out on a lot of stuff - but I am here now ...hope to see your lovely wife here sometime soon.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>Gokart'sGirl||||reg||1
Z||000012||Gokart'sGirl||07-26-2000||11:04 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Coconut:<BR><B>Hi Gokart's Girl,<BR>  Welcome...it's always great too see new members on board!</B><P>Thank you Coconut for the warm welcome!<P><B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I gotta hand it to you, taking the time to be with your man while he is spending time working on his Fiero is fantastic. It's great to know a guy can spend time with BOTH of his loves and not have to worry about not spending enough time with the other. Definately a big plus!</B><P>LOL I have to admit I have not always been so supportive, but I have come to realize over these many years that if you can't beat them the only thing you can do it join them ... lol so I did!<P><B> I know that one from experience. Fiero GTGirl is almost always keeping me company while I'm fixing something on the car. She keeps me laughing even when I would think I would be frustrated. GoKart should consider himself lucky  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I know I am!!</B><P>I did not know FieroGTGirl was your lady...how lucky you both are to have one another - and it is I who concider myself the lucky one ... Gokart is a wonderful man! <P><BR><B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Once again, welcome aboard!<P> Cruisin' On,  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thank you again Coconut !  <P><P>------------------<BR>Gokart'sGirl||||reg||1
Z||000013||Gokart'sGirl||07-26-2000||11:14 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Gokart:<BR><B>I DO know how lucky I am and try not to take it for granted! Man I was shocked enough to see my girl post on my pics when I got home last night and thought for sure that would most likely be it forever, but nope! Here she is hangin' with the Fiero crew  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Hey tg how bout a sig for me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>LOL Oh Gokart you had to know I would eventually give up the ghost and join ...what choice did I have - all those great topics I was missing out on and all these awesome folks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.  Plus this way I know I will get to chat with you on the computer ...hehehe.<P>But seriously my love thank you for sharing your wonderful world of Fieros with me! You are the Best! <BR> <P>------------------<BR>Gokart'sGirl||||reg||1
Z||000014||Gokart'sGirl||07-26-2000||11:18 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by snowkttn:<BR><B>Welcome GoKart's girl........glad another female has joined.  Feel like I know you both from the smooth dealing we had awhile back   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Gee snowkttn thanks for the welcome! And I am really glad it all went well! Good to see you!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> back at ya!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Gokart'sGirl||||reg||1
